        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Document Layout</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 40px;\n        background-color: #d1d5db; /* Grey background to contrast the page */\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;\n    }\n\n    .notebook-page {\n        width: 850px;\n        background-color: #fcfbf7; /* Cream color */\n        position: relative;\n        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px; /* Spine on left */\n        /* Grid background */\n        background-image: \n            linear-gradient(#efebe0 1px, transparent 1px),\n            linear-gradient(90deg, #efebe0 1px, transparent 1px);\n        background-size: 18px 18px;\n        padding: 40px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    /* Tabs */\n    .tabs {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: -28px;\n        top: 40px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 2px;\n    }\n    .tab {\n        width: 28px;\n        height: 30px;\n        border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\n        color: white;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        box-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n    }\n    /* Approximate tab colors */\n    .t1 { background: #b0706a; } .t2 { background: #adbd75; }\n    .t3 { background: #7ab2cc; } .t4 { background: #858cc1; }\n    .t5 { background: #8d989f; } .t6 { background: #cba277; }\n    .t7 { background: #96ba84; } .t8 { background: #bfd06c; }\n    .t9 { background: #7aafd0; } .t10 { background: #6b93ca; }\n    .t11 { background: #b49374; } .t12 { background: #cbac89; }\n    .t13 { background: #93bf88; } .t14 { background: #bfce6d; }\n    .t15 { background: #82b6ce; } .t16 { background: #6c97cb; }\n\n    /* Inner dashed border */\n    .inner-border {\n        border: 2px dashed #e3dac7;\n        height: 100%;\n        padding: 35px 25px 25px 25px;\n        position: relative;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    /* Header */\n    .header {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        pointer-events: none; \n    }\n    .avatar-wrapper {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -45px;\n        left: -15px;\n        z-index: 10;\n    }\n    .placeholder.avatar {\n        width: 70px;\n        height: 70px;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        background-color: #eaeaea;\n        border: 2px solid white;\n        box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #555;\n    }\n    .meta-fields {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: -20px;\n        right: 25px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .meta-box {\n        background-color: #f2ebd8;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        padding: 4px 30px 4px 10px;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #bfae91;\n        min-width: 60px;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    /* Watermark styling (approximate simulation) */\n    .watermark {\n        position: absolute;\n        color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);\n        font-size: 26px;\n        font-family: cursive, sans-serif;\n        transform: rotate(-20deg);\n        pointer-events: none;\n        user-select: none;\n    }\n    .wm1 { top: 30px; left: 160px; }\n    .wm2 { top: 30px; right: 120px; }\n    .wm3 { top: 280px; left: 30px; }\n    .wm4 { top: 400px; left: 300px; }\n    .wm5 { top: 280px; right: 20px; }\n    .wm6 { top: 700px; left: 100px; }\n    .wm7 { top: 700px; right: 150px; }\n    .wm8 { top: 900px; left: 300px; }\n\n\n    /* Content Layout */\n    .content-block {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 20px;\n        margin-top: 25px;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n        position: relative;\n        z-index: 1;\n    }\n    \n    .col-image {\n        flex: 0 0 35%;\n    }\n    .col-text {\n        flex: 1;\n        font-size: 16.5px;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        text-align: justify;\n        color: #1a1a1a;\n    }\n    .col-text p {\n        margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Placeholders */\n    .placeholder {\n        background-color: #e5e5e5;\n        border: 1px dashed #999;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #666;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .photo-1 {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 290px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .photo-2 {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 440px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    .photo-3 {\n        float: right;\n        width: 135px;\n        height: 180px;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 15px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n\n    /* Typography specifics */\n    .chinese-text {\n        font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    \n    .highlight {\n        background-color: #fff266;\n        padding: 0 2px;\n    }\n    \n    .annotation-wrap {\n        position: relative;\n        display: inline-block;\n    }\n    .annotation {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 100%;\n        left: -15px;\n        color: #c00000;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        line-height: 1;\n        margin-top: 3px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"notebook-page\">\n    <!-- Watermarks -->\n    <div class=\"watermark wm1\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark wm2\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark wm3\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark wm4\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark wm5\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark wm6\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark wm7\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n    <div class=\"watermark wm8\">Sophie欣欣</div>\n\n    <!-- Tabs along the right edge -->\n    <div class=\"tabs\">\n        <div class=\"tab t1\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t2\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t3\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t4\">04</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t5\">05</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t6\">06</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t7\">07</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t8\">08</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t9\">09</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t10\">10</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t11\">11</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t12\">12</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t13\">13</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t14\">14</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t15\">15</div>\n        <div class=\"tab t16\">16</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Area bounded by the dashed border -->\n    <div class=\"inner-border\">\n        \n        <!-- Header Elements Overlapping the Border -->\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <div class=\"avatar-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder avatar\">[Avatar Image]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"meta-fields\">\n                <div class=\"meta-box\">Chapter</div>\n                <div class=\"meta-box\">Date</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- First Content Section -->\n        <div class=\"content-block\">\n            <div class=\"col-image\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder photo-1\">[Photo: Person in black shirt]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-text\">\n                <p>\n                    hair. The SEVENTEEN member permed his bangs as well to blend them in seamlessly with the rest of his hair. It gave them a \n                    <span class=\"annotation-wrap\">\n                        <span class=\"highlight\">fluffed-up</span>\n                        <span class=\"annotation\">(adj.) 蓬松的，蓬松状的</span>\n                    </span>\n                    look that nicely framed his face and added tons of texture.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"chinese-text\">\n                    第二，他把头发打理成了<span class=\"highlight\">波浪的</span>刘海短发。在K-pop偶像中，波浪短发是一种流行的发型，许多人会将短发打理成波浪状，增加发型的质感和蓬松感。尹净汉选择了一款可爱的波浪短发，因为他有着长发，所以这个发型显得有质感且蓬松。这位SEVENTEEN成员还将刘海打理成波浪状，使其与其他头发无缝融合。这使得刘海显得<span class=\"highlight\">蓬松</span>，优美地勾勒出他的脸部线条并增添了丰富的质感。\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Second Content Section -->\n        <div class=\"content-block\">\n            <div class=\"col-image\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder photo-2\">[Photo: Person in blue shirt with mic]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-text\">\n                <p>\n                    Third, he had straight hair with braided front sections. When one has long hair, experimenting with braids is a must. Jeonghan incorporated a beautiful braid into the front sections of his hair, almost making it seem like the braid replaced a headband to hold the rest of his hair in place. He left his hair straight and smooth throughout, incorporating texture with the fun use of braids. He also left out his bangs to allow them to frame his face and highlight his gorgeous features.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"chinese-text\">\n                    <div class=\"placeholder photo-3\">[Photo: Small portrait, bottom right]</div>\n                    第三，他曾留过直发，前面的部分编成了辫子。拥有长发时，尝试编发是必不可少的。尹净汉在头发的前部分编了一条漂亮的辫子，几乎让人感觉这条辫子取代了发箍，将其余的头发固定在一起。他保持又直又光滑的头发，通过有趣的编发方式增加了质感。他还把刘海留了出来，使其能够装饰他的脸庞，突出他迷人的特点。\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
